{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33993","headline":"奉和鲁望白鸥诗 · 皮日休","name":"奉和鲁望白鸥诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"雪羽䙰褷半惹泥，海云深处旧巢迷。\n池无飞浪争教舞，洲少轻沙若遣栖。\n烟外失羣慙雁鹜，波中得志羡凫鷖。\n主人恩重真难遇，莫爲心孤忆旧溪。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"皮日休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33993.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33993","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}